Author: Yuriy Aleksandrov <yatweety@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 03:25:19 2026 +0200

    fix(shared): ask each exercise id once, keep cancellation, skip switched lookups
    
    One failed editor lookup is one request and one notice, and an id the server omits is not asked again on the same open. keepExercises no longer swallows CancellationException. A switched floor prefetch keeps no exercise entries. Tests: drop a redundant SyncNotices assertion, retag the bootstrap lookup test.
    
    Flow-Key: panel-fix-1

